{"id":"leider","lemma":"leider","pos":"adv","rank":444,"glosses":["unfortunately"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɪ̯dɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/De-leider.ogg/De-leider.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe leider keine Erfahrung.","en":"I'm afraid I have no experience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745728","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"experience"}]},{"text":"Ich muss jetzt leider gehen.","en":"I'm afraid I have to go now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Wir können es leider nicht ändern.","en":"Unfortunately, there's nothing we can do to change it.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to change, to alter"}]},{"text":"Leider ist das wahr.","en":"Unfortunately, that's true.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"true, real"}]},{"text":"Das ist leider nicht gut genug.","en":"I'm afraid that's not good enough.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"enough"}]}]}